# Road Accident Analysis Dashboard (Power BI)

## 📊 Project Overview
This dashboard is created using Microsoft Power BI to analyze road accident data and identify accident patterns.

## 🎯 Objective
- To analyze accident severity
- To study weather and area-based accident trends
- To understand time-based accident occurrence

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Excel Dataset

