👉 Screenshot added in repository.

## 📈 Key Insights
- Accident severity distribution
- Weather condition impact
- Area-wise accident frequency
- Driver age analysis

## 🚀 Conclusion
This dashboard helps to understand road accident patterns and supports safety decision-making.
